{"content":"Now I have a comprehensive picture. Let me compile the distinct enforcement sites:\n\nh15.\n\n1. **GetMemo access check** (`checkMemoReadAccess`) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go` (lines 55–66: denies unauthenticated access to non-PUBLIC memos; denies non-creator access to PRIVATE memos)\n\n2. **ListMemos query-level visibility filter** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go` (lines 218–227: restricts `VisibilityList` to PUBLIC for anonymous, PUBLIC+PROTECTED for non-owner authenticated)\n\n3. **CreateMemoComment visibility gate** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go` (line 41: blocks commenting on PRIVATE memos by non-creators; also forces comment visibility to match parent at line 52)\n\n4. **UpdateMemo parent-visibility enforcement for comments** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go` (lines 452–463: when updating a comment's visibility, overrides it to the parent memo's visibility)\n\n5. **ListMemoRelations visibility filter** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_relation_service.go` (lines 108–111: applies `MemoFilter` scoped by visibility so related memos the caller cannot see are excluded)\n\n6. **Attachment access check** (`checkAttachmentAccess`) — `server/router/api/v1/attachment_service.go` (lines 422–455: linked attachments inherit memo visibility rules)\n\n7. **ListMemoAttachments visibility check** — `server/router/api/v1/memo_attachment_service.go` (lines 213–224: checks memo visibility before returning its attachments)\n\n8. **Reaction service visibility checks** — `server/router/api/v1/reaction_service.go` (lines 29–41 for ListMemoReactions; line 83 for UpsertReaction: both enforce memo visibility before allowing reaction reads/writes)\n\n9. **SSE delivery filtering** (`canReceive`) — `server/router/api/v1/sse_hub.go` (lines 134–144: PRIVATE events delivered only to the creator or admin)\n\n10. **Mention/notification access guard** (`canUserAccessMentionContext`) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_mention_helpers.go` (lines 56–72: suppresses mention notifications for PRIVATE memos the target cannot access)\n\n11. **Email notification visibility guard** (`canViewerAccessMemo`) — `server/notification/email.go` (lines 306–320: prevents email notifications about memos the viewer cannot see)\n\n12. **User stats visibility filter** — `server/router/api/v1/user_service_stats.go` (lines 83–91 for `ListAllUserStats`; lines 217–221 for `GetUserStats`: both restrict counted memos by visibility)\n\n13. **RSS feed visibility filter** — `server/router/rss/rss.go` (lines 90, 141: both global and per-user RSS feeds restrict to PUBLIC only)\n\n14. **Sitemap visibility filter** — `server/router/frontend/frontend.go` (line 150: sitemap includes only PUBLIC memos)","iteration":10,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
